31,1,1,talk,Rin,,Everyone! I know who the werewolf is! It's Asuka!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"That was fast. Rin, are you the Seer?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Claiming the Seer role on day one is a bold move. Are you sure, Rin?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Asuka,,This is absurd. I am a human. Rin is lying to frame me.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,A direct accusation immediately. How interesting. Is this a genuine lead or a bluff?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm the Seer! I checked Asuka last night and she's the werewolf!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Rin is the Seer, the logic is simple. But if she's the werewolf, she's trying to eliminate Asuka.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Asuka, do you have any defense other than calling it absurd?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I have no special role to prove my innocence. I am a villager. Rin is manipulating us.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, you seem very eager to question Asuka. Are you trying to steer the vote?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm not lying! I promise! Please believe me!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Toshio,,The probability of a villager claiming Seer so early is low.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'm just analyzing the situation. I don't have a reason to protect Asuka.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Rin is too energetic; she's overcompensating. It's a classic deception.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I find Rin's conviction refreshing, but Asuka's coldness is typical of a wolf.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Please, let's just vote for Asuka!","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I'll trust the Seer's claim for now.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"If we execute a villager, we lose a valuable human. But the risk of keeping a wolf is higher.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Asuka,,You are all being led by a child's whim.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I'll go with the evidence provided. Asuka, you're out.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
